sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Admin
  participant API as /me/approval-passkey
  participant AP as approval service
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant M as Resend

  U->>API: POST /options
  API->>AP: active admin? signed in recently? no passkey yet?
  AP->>DB: store challenge (register_passkey, 5 min)
  AP-->>U: WebAuthn registration options (user verification required)
  U->>U: create platform passkey
  U->>API: POST /verify
  API->>AP: lock user, consume challenge, verifyRegistrationResponse
  AP->>DB: insert approval_passkeys + audit approval_passkey.enrolled
  AP->>M: email every admin (after commit)
